<div class="info-page apple-doc-page">

    <!-- Official Apple Support Hero -->
    <header class="info-hero apple-doc-hero">
        <div class="apple-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path>
                <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="info-eyebrow"><%- include('../partials/brand-mark.ejs') %>Stayora Support</span>
        <h1 class="info-title">How can we help you?</h1>
        <p class="info-subtitle">
            Clear answers about booking curated stays, hosting properties, cancellation policies, and keeping your Stayora account secure.
        </p>

        <div class="apple-support-pills">
            <a href="#faq-booking" class="category-pill">Booking a Stay</a>
            <a href="#hosting-guide" class="category-pill">Become a Host</a>
            <a href="#faq-policies" class="category-pill">Cancellations</a>
            <a href="#faq-security" class="category-pill">Password &amp; Security</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 3 Apple Support Topic Cards -->
    <section class="info-grid-3" aria-label="Support categories">
        <a href="#faq-booking" class="feature-tile apple-topic-card">
            <span class="apple-tile-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="3"></rect>
                    <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
                    <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
                    <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
                </svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Bookings &amp; Stays</h3>
            <p>Search by city, compare room categories, check real-time availability, and confirm your trip.</p>
            <span class="apple-topic-link">View answers &rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a href="#hosting-guide" class="feature-tile apple-topic-card">
            <span class="apple-tile-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M3 10.5 12 3l9 7.5"></path>
                    <path d="M5 9.5V20a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V9.5"></path>
                    <path d="M9.5 21v-6h5v6"></path>
                </svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Hosting on Stayora</h3>
            <p>Upgrade to a Host account, list your property, manage room inventory, and earn Verified Host status.</p>
            <span class="apple-topic-link">Hosting guide &rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a href="#faq-security" class="feature-tile apple-topic-card">
            <span class="apple-tile-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
                    <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
                </svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Account &amp; Security</h3>
            <p>OTP email verification, Google sign-in, password resets, and automatic session protection.</p>
            <span class="apple-topic-link">Security help &rarr;</span>
        </a>
    </section>

    <!-- Apple Accordion FAQ Section -->
    <section class="info-card-white apple-faq-card">
        <div class="apple-faq-head">
            <span class="apple-section-kicker">Knowledge Base</span>
            <h2 class="info-section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-list">
            <details id="faq-booking" class="faq-item">
                <summary>How do I book a room on Stayora?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    Browse properties on the Stays page, click &ldquo;Explore&rdquo; on any stay you like, scroll down to the &ldquo;Choose your room&rdquo; section, and click &ldquo;Book This Room&rdquo;. Sign in to your Stayora account, choose your dates and room count, and confirm instantly.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details id="hosting-guide" class="faq-item">
                <summary>How do I become a Host and list my property?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    Log in to your Stayora account and click &ldquo;+ Become a Host&rdquo; in the navigation bar. Your account upgrades immediately to a Host account, unlocking your Host Dashboard where you can add properties, upload photos, and manage rooms.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>What does &ldquo;Verified Host&rdquo; mean?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    A Verified Host badge indicates that the host&rsquo;s account and property details have been reviewed and approved by the Stayora moderation team for accuracy, quality, and authenticity.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details id="faq-policies" class="faq-item">
                <summary>Where can I check check-in, check-out, and cancellation policies?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    Every property detail page clearly displays the exact check-in time, check-out time, and cancellation policy (Flexible, Moderate, or Strict) under &ldquo;Things to know&rdquo; before you book - and your policy is locked in on your booking confirmation.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details id="faq-security" class="faq-item">
                <summary>I forgot my password. How can I reset it?</summary>
                <p class="faq-answer">
                    Go to the Log in page and click &ldquo;Forgot password?&rdquo;. Enter your registered email address and follow the secure 10-minute reset link sent to your inbox. Resetting your password automatically signs out all older sessions.
                </p>
            </details>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Apple Support Bottom CTA -->
    <section class="info-cta-bar apple-support-cta">
        <span class="apple-section-kicker">Get Support</span>
        <h2>Still need help?</h2>
        <p>Our Stayora support team is just a phone call or email away, seven days a week.</p>
        <div class="apple-cta-actions">
            <a href="/contact" class="info-btn">Contact Support</a>
            <a href="/listings" class="apple-btn-soft">Browse Stays</a>
        </div>
    </section>

</div>
